=== Session opus-2026-05-27-S6: Extended results ===

CONFIRMED: H(T) = I(Omega(T), 2) is a UNIVERSAL identity for all tournaments.
Verified n=2..6 (36,866 tournaments, 0 failures).
Earlier "counterexamples" were due to a bug: deduplication by vertex set
instead of by directed cycle. MISTAKE-004 retraction confirmed correct.

Staircase H(T_k) values (verified via OCF identity):
  H(T_2)=5, H(T_3)=29, H(T_4)=233, H(T_5)=2489, H(T_6)=33773

a(12) LOWER BOUND:
  Best found: 531205 (4/8 independent trials in 90s)
  Two local optima: 531175 (sub-optimal basin) and 531205 (main basin)
  Multiple distinct tournaments achieve 531205.
  Confidence: HIGH that a(12) = 531205.

a(13) LOWER BOUND (in progress):
  5-min search: best = 3719831 (seed 0x33333333)
  10-min search (ongoing): best so far 3719831
  Less convergence than n=12; true maximum unclear.

Growth ratios:
  a(12)/a(11) >= 531205/95095 ~= 5.586
  a(13)/a(12) >= 3719831/531205 ~= 7.0 (estimate)

